{"text":"kuruntokai","n":97,"lines":["யானே ஈண்டை யேனே யென்னலனே","ஆனா நோயொடு கான லஃதே","துறைவன் தம்மூ ரானே","மறையல ராகி மன்றத் தஃதே"],"tr":["yāṉē īṇṭai yēṉē yeṉṉalaṉē","āṉā nōyoṭu kāṉa laḵtē","tuṟaivaṉ tammū rāṉē","maṟaiyala rāki maṉṟat taḵtē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"வெண்பூதியார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Veṇpūtiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 5"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"யானே","tr":"yāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]},{"text":"ஈண்டை","tr":"īṇṭai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஈண்","tr":"īṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டை","tr":"ṭai"}]},{"text":"யேனே","tr":"yēṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]},{"text":"யென்னலனே","tr":"yeṉṉalaṉē","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யென்","tr":"yeṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"னல","tr":"ṉala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}],[{"text":"ஆனா","tr":"āṉā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னா","tr":"ṉā"}]},{"text":"நோயொடு","tr":"nōyoṭu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நோ","tr":"nō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யொடு","tr":"yoṭu"}]},{"text":"கான","tr":"kāṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]},{"text":"லஃதே","tr":"laḵtē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லஃ","tr":"laḵ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}],[{"text":"துறைவன்","tr":"tuṟaivaṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துறை","tr":"tuṟai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வன்","tr":"vaṉ"}]},{"text":"தம்மூ","tr":"tammū","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தம்","tr":"tam"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மூ","tr":"mū"}]},{"text":"ரானே","tr":"rāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரா","tr":"rā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}],[{"text":"மறையல","tr":"maṟaiyala","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மறை","tr":"maṟai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யல","tr":"yala"}]},{"text":"ராகி","tr":"rāki","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரா","tr":"rā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கி","tr":"ki"}]},{"text":"மன்றத்","tr":"maṉṟat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மன்","tr":"maṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றத்","tr":"ṟat"}]},{"text":"தஃதே","tr":"taḵtē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தஃ","tr":"taḵ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"I indeed"},{"surface":"ஈண்டையேனே","parts":[{"text":"ஈண்டை","lemma":"ஈண்டை","gloss":"here"},{"text":"ஏன்","lemma":"ஏன்","gloss":"I am"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"am right here"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"நலனே","parts":[{"text":"நலன்","lemma":"நலன்","gloss":"beauty"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"beauty indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஆனா","parts":[{"text":"ஆனா","lemma":"ஆனா","gloss":"unceasing"}],"gloss":"unceasing"},{"surface":"நோயொடு","parts":[{"text":"நோய்","lemma":"நோய்","gloss":"pain"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with pain"},{"surface":"கானல்","parts":[{"text":"கானல்","lemma":"கானல்","gloss":"seaside grove"}],"gloss":"seaside grove"},{"surface":"அஃதே","parts":[{"text":"அஃது","lemma":"அஃது","gloss":"that"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is there"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துறைவன்","parts":[{"text":"துறைவன்","lemma":"துறைவன்","gloss":"lord of the shore"}],"gloss":"the lord of the shore"},{"surface":"தம்","parts":[{"text":"தம்","lemma":"தம்","gloss":"his"}],"gloss":"his"},{"surface":"ஊரானே","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஆன்","gloss":"locative suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is in his town"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மறை","parts":[{"text":"மறை","lemma":"மறை","gloss":"secret"}],"gloss":"secret"},{"surface":"அலர்","parts":[{"text":"அலர்","lemma":"அலர்","gloss":"public gossip"}],"gloss":"public gossip"},{"surface":"ஆகி","parts":[{"text":"ஆகி","lemma":"ஆகி","gloss":"having become"}],"gloss":"having become"},{"surface":"மன்றத்தஃதே","parts":[{"text":"மன்றத்து","lemma":"மன்றம்","gloss":"public square"},{"text":"அஃது","lemma":"அஃது","gloss":"that"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is in the public square"}]}],"literal":"I indeed am right here / My beauty, with unceasing pain, is there in the seaside grove / The lord of the shore is in his own town / The secret, having become public gossip, is there in the public square.","translation":"I am right here. My beauty, along with endless pain, is left behind in the seaside grove. The lord of the shore is in his own town. And our secret, now turned into public gossip, is out in the open assembly.","modern":"நான் இங்கேயே இருக்கிறேன். என் அழகோ, நீங்காத துன்பத்துடன் நெய்தல் நிலக் கடற்கரைச் சோலையிலேயே தங்கிவிட்டது. துறைவனோ அவனுடைய சொந்த ஊரில் இருக்கிறான். எங்களது இரகசியக் காதலோ, ஊரார் பேசும் அலராகிப் பொது மன்றத்தில் அம்பலமாகிவிட்டது.","explanation":"In this poem, the heroine expresses her deep distress and sense of fragmentation to her close friend during the hero's absence. She describes her situation through four distinct locations, highlighting her isolation. She herself is confined to her home, while her lost beauty and endless grief remain at the seaside grove where they used to meet. Meanwhile, the lord of the shore has returned to his own town, seemingly unaffected. To make matters worse, their secret love has now become public gossip, discussed openly in the village common ground. This spatial division perfectly captures the emotional disintegration of the heroine in the Neytal (seashore) landscape, which is characterized by separation and anxious waiting.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.3,3.54],[3.54,3.62],[3.7,4.2],[4.2,4.7],[4.78,5.0],[5.0,5.53],[5.53,6.6],[6.6,6.92],[6.92,7.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.5,2.0],[2.0,3.1],[3.1,3.6],[3.6,4.1],[4.1,4.5],[4.5,5.87],[6.1,6.38],[6.38,6.38],[6.38,6.67],[6.67,7.8],[7.8,8.55],[8.55,8.68]]}}